// Served by the `marks.bitmaps` RPC rather than bundled into the client; the
// ids and the monochrome set live in client/components/marks.ts.
//
// React Native's <Image> decodes PNG, JPEG, GIF, and WebP. It does not decode
// SVG: that needs react-native-svg, and the plugin sandbox only exposes react,
// react-native, @tanstack/react-query, zod, and the Paseo SDK entry points. So
// every brand mark ships here as a PNG raster of the vendor's own SVG, drawn at
// 96px for a 21px slot on a three-times display.
//
// A monochrome mark is rasterised white and tinted at render time; a brand mark
// keeps the vendor's colours and is never tinted.
//
// The tool-row marks (MCP services, shell programs, and brand:github) are
// line icons that sit beside the host's Lucide icons, so they are drawn at the
// host's 1.5 stroke. Their sources are assets/tool-marks/*.svg; rebuild them
// with `node scripts/build-tool-marks.mjs`.

